---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PricingCards from "../components/PricingCards.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing — Rota"
  description="Rota is free to download. Voice mode is an optional paid add-on."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <h1>Free to download. Voice mode when you want it.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The HUD, window tiling, macros, gestures and sync are free. Voice mode
        is the one paid feature.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section aria-label="Plans">
      <PricingCards />
    </section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="pricing-faq">
      <h2 id="pricing-faq">Questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>What do I get for free?</summary>
        <p>
          Everything except Voice mode: the radial HUD, window tiling, Chrome
          tabs and bookmarks, Slack channels, macros and hotkeys, profiles and
          layers, per-app overrides, ZSA Navigator gestures and settings sync.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How does Voice mode work?</summary>
        <p>
          Start Voice mode from the HUD or its hotkey and say a short command.
          Rota transcribes it with your configured provider (OpenAI, or
          OpenRouter/xAI), ranks your own actions and shows the top three.
          Nothing runs until you confirm. It uses your own API key, so provider
          usage is billed by that provider.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I unlock Voice mode after paying?</summary>
        <p>
          Checkout is handled by Stripe. Afterwards you get a license key.
          Paste it into Rota to unlock Voice mode on up to three of your
          Macs. The app re-checks the license periodically and keeps working
          offline in between.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do I need a ZSA Navigator?</summary>
        <p>
          No. Every HUD and action can be reached from an Apple trackpad or a
          keyboard hotkey. The Navigator adds direct touch input and tuning.
        </p>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
